{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0dfb3000c6bce7b9f4e983f460679c1aaa4107d3f595df810ec086aa159562e0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c651a4edeb262b60e68be90057273ec3820937cb5ce054adbc34bc0ef7376efe"],"source_ids":["src_ca7384f550775d82b359b3ed9fb67ee6"],"text":"While the world runs, each agent's current state is written to a text file in the agents/ folder, letting users observe what agents are doing.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0f30224cd5a009b77255ff4acd4cf574d153af37c74d0a7324aa97232b3c6dfc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_733cf886263e0a7eef45a5f720e0de75e39bc84fdb7fa4bb4ca8d2bd5da2b7a2"],"source_ids":["src_728066ec12e157248ce2a7fefb37996d"],"text":"The Discord bot configuration guide is described as basic, and running the Discord bots in production is stated to be at the user's own risk with permissions to be optimized as needed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1cf27595c5566683e6ec00f65671a5e091abfea36982c20dac59f54a8c5bfcfb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1895463559eb993f2b591df2e8a4fc90b19ce086ee13786b0992c4977e53372a"],"source_ids":["src_ca7384f550775d82b359b3ed9fb67ee6"],"text":"GPTeam uses GPT-4 to create multiple agents that collaborate to achieve predefined goals, aiming to explore GPT models' potential for multi-agent productivity and communication.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3a0733c8f0467b61f304c90ef7e1da85b21811d5c0f521d09ca2b5429858a6d5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0a73545aefb1354d7f38c9b74f744335f5ee29e240ebf43e6697d386f0701ca6","slc_562c03330c4a84fde2741d5661db41494c9f46f1334e580a6ff58d326fa1ed6e"],"source_ids":["src_728066ec12e157248ce2a7fefb37996d"],"text":"Discord setup requires channel IDs per location in .env as <LOCATION_NAME>_CHANNEL_ID and bot tokens as <BOT_FIRST_NAME>_DISCORD_TOKEN, with the announcer bot needing Message Content Intent enabled.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4c613ada48f3bb0afd4be8f9e0c88789e7cb61016be21813a3cc1825208a9b6e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0f313781cdef57ece96678d8f08975c444f83e4bb76a50a8b79da7631ceeb8fb"],"source_ids":["src_ca7384f550775d82b359b3ed9fb67ee6"],"text":"The project requires an OpenAI API key in .env; supplying keys for optional services enables additional tools, and the project is managed with Poetry.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5e73729f5f75557f071987b963f5d208d9f4cab32f3c0329281a5417ec006634","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2c78181df394fd0fd245430b95e3e681dc47c305236f13c8a04a94e01ecee9c6"],"source_ids":["src_728066ec12e157248ce2a7fefb37996d"],"text":"In the Discord integration, each world maps to a Discord guild, each location to a channel, each agent to a separate bot application, plus an announcer bot that announces agent movement between rooms.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8f96e7e793fad84452f741e87c2de3ea7568e9ac4623487ecda4e1de36eee36e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bd1eef9ab3c25a25a4a90edc96b9b920dc16b798ce813bb46def205dca6baccc"],"source_ids":["src_ca7384f550775d82b359b3ed9fb67ee6"],"text":"The world is configured via a config.json file listing available agents and locations; after editing it, users reset the database and relaunch the world.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9475ffb2e42d460f17b245b53b7db8b5611fcc8546307e95910439ba5c34e2b5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_aae23d9affee5874ecbc329118001d4d1c3e4649befa101f6a89b1695b958a1a","slc_e4651380b05ec1deb47402f7b3ac4d751f079e32326a7564394dfbf02b082d8f"],"source_ids":["src_ca7384f550775d82b359b3ed9fb67ee6"],"text":"A --turbo flag runs all LLM calls with gpt3.5-turbo for lower cost, at the cost of worse results; a --claude flag uses claude-v1 and claude-v1-instant for some calls.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9daa50338107ff699ba6e9127d46b042e5a2625eec6f34e4b2afd4bdcbde98d1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_751b491d285baad6ccfcfb1f416c64121d89470d476288e045622888a391dd6e"],"source_ids":["src_ca7384f550775d82b359b3ed9fb67ee6"],"text":"Agents move around the world, perform tasks in different locations depending on their activity and other agents' positions, and can speak to each other and collaborate on tasks in parallel.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","created_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9effc15bd611862f9b34dc1caad046decaf2d1c8fc0ac9d394b01279358cace3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"101dotxyz/gpteam@a216364ea2db snapshot 10cf6cc6e085a03c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_751b491d285baad6ccfcfb1f416c64121d89470d476288e045622888a391dd6e"],"source_ids":["src_ca7384f550775d82b359b3ed9fb67ee6"],"text":"Each agent has its own memory and uses communication as a tool; agent memory and reflection are inspired by a cited research paper (arXiv 2304.03442).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:28:23Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d337ff31220b455fb492265d674b36c1"}
